# scripts/kg-viewer-strings.ts: the knowledge-graph viewer's UI string table, its gettext catalogues and how they reach
# the page generated by scripts/kg-viewer.ts. Each Scenario names the test that executes it.
Feature: Knowledge-graph viewer strings and catalogues

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_viewer's_strings_and_its_table::every_T()_call_names_a_string_the_table_declares
  Scenario: Every T() call in the viewer generator names a string the table declares
    Given the T() calls read from the source of kg-viewer.ts
    When their msgids are compared with the English strings of the UI string table
    Then no called string is missing from the table

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_viewer's_strings_and_its_table::every_declared_string_is_asked_for_by_the_page
  Scenario: Every declared string is asked for by the page
    Given the English strings of the UI string table
    When they are compared with the T() calls read from kg-viewer.ts
    Then no declared string goes uncalled

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_viewer's_strings_and_its_table::the_generator_finds_the_calls_at_all
  Scenario: The T() call reader finds the calls at all
    Given the source of kg-viewer.ts
    When its T() calls are read
    Then there are at least as many as the table has strings

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_viewer's_strings_and_its_table::every_entry_carries_a_translator_comment,_and_names_its_placeholders
  Scenario: Every table entry carries a translator comment that names its placeholders
    Given every entry of the UI string table
    When its comment is read
    Then the comment is longer than 20 characters
    And it names every "{placeholder}" in the English string

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_viewer's_strings_and_its_table::the_POT_entries_point_at_real_lines_of_the_table
  Scenario: The POT entries point at real lines of the table
    Given the source of kg-viewer-strings.ts
    When its POT entries are derived
    Then there is one per table string
    And each points past line 1 at a line containing its msgid

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::every_locale_has_a_stub_carrying_every_msgid_the_viewer_says
  Scenario: Every shipped locale has a stub carrying every msgid
    Given the kg-viewer.po catalogue of each of ar, es, fr, ru and zh in the declared translations directory
    When its entries are parsed
    Then its msgids are exactly the table's English strings

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::and_not_one_of_them_is_filled_in_—_that_is_the_decision,_not_an_omission
  Scenario: No shipped catalogue has a translated string
    Given the kg-viewer.po catalogue of each of ar, es, fr, ru and zh
    When its entries are parsed
    Then every msgstr is empty

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::so_the_shipped_page_offers_English_and_nothing_else
  Scenario: The shipped page offers English and nothing else
    Given the harness root
    When the catalogues are loaded
    Then none is loaded

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::...and_shows_every_shipped_locale_as_PLANNED,_disabled_(bean_w6fu)
  Scenario: Every shipped locale is shown as planned, disabled
    Given the harness root
    When the planned locales are read
    Then they are ar, es, fr, ru and zh
    And "ar" is planned with direction "rtl"

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::a_catalogue's_first_translated_string_enables_it,_with_no_code_change
  Scenario: A catalogue's first translated string enables it with no code change
    Given a scratch tree with a "qaa" catalogue whose "Nodes" msgstr is empty
    When the catalogues and planned locales are read
    Then no catalogue is loaded and "qaa" is planned
    And once "Nodes" is translated as "NODES", "qaa" is loaded and nothing is planned

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::a_catalogue_is_unofficial_until_its_own_file_says_otherwise
  Scenario: A catalogue is unofficial until its own file says otherwise
    Given a po header "X-Folio-Official: yes"
    When the header field is read
    Then it is "yes"
    And a header without the field reads as undefined
    And each shipped catalogue's X-Folio-Official reads "no"

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::a_half-written_catalogue_is_taken_at_exactly_its_own_word
  Scenario: A half-written catalogue is taken at exactly its own word
    Given a scratch tree where "qaa" translates "Nodes" as "NODES" and leaves "Kind" empty
    And "qab" leaves "Nodes" empty
    When the catalogues are loaded
    Then only "qaa" is loaded
    And its strings are only Nodes to "NODES", with 1 translated
    And it is not official

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_catalogues_that_ship::the_writing_direction_comes_from_the_tag,_so_Arabic_turns_the_page
  Scenario: The writing direction comes from the locale tag
    Given the locale tags ar, ar-EG, fr, zh and qaa
    When their direction and name are read
    Then "ar" and "ar-EG" are "rtl" and "fr" is "ltr"
    And "zh" is named "中文"
    And the unknown tag "qaa" is named "qaa"

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_generated_page::English_is_offered_even_when_there_is_no_catalogue_at_all
  Scenario: English is offered even when there is no catalogue at all
    # Gap: that the switcher does not appear with a single choice is not checked
    Given no catalogues
    When the viewer HTML is generated
    Then it contains the locale "en"
    And it defines LOCALES
    And it defines STRINGS as an empty object

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_generated_page::a_planned_language_reaches_the_page_as_PLANNED,_never_as_a_choice
  Scenario: A planned language reaches the page as planned, never as a choice
    Given one planned locale "xx" named "Test"
    When the viewer HTML is generated
    Then PLANNED holds that locale
    And LOCALES does not name "xx"

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_generated_page::a_catalogue_reaches_the_page,_whole
  Scenario: A catalogue reaches the page whole
    Given a catalogue "xx" translating "Nodes" as "NODES-XX"
    When the viewer HTML is generated
    Then it contains "NODES-XX"
    And it contains the locale "xx"

  @test:scripts/tests/ui/kg-viewer-strings.test.ts::the_generated_page::nothing_a_catalogue_carries_can_end_the_template_literal_or_the_script
  Scenario: Nothing a catalogue carries can end the template literal or the script
    Given a catalogue whose translation holds a backtick, "${x}" and a closing script tag
    When the viewer HTML is generated
    Then the STRINGS payload holds no backtick, no "${" and no "</script"
    And it holds the escaped forms "`" and "${x}"
